flowchart TD
  Start([User opens extension])
  Start --> EnterQuery[Enter search query]
  EnterQuery --> SendRequest[Extension sends POST /search]
  SendRequest --> Auth[Backend validates/auth]
  Auth --> Normalize[Query normalization]
  Normalize --> EmbedReq[Request embedding (LLM/embed API)]
  EmbedReq --> VectorSearch[Vector search (Chroma)]
  VectorSearch --> Candidates[Select candidate passages]
  Candidates --> BuildPrompt[Build prompt + context]
  BuildPrompt --> LLMCall[Call LLM for answer]
  LLMCall -->|success| ReturnAnswer[Post-process and return answer]
  LLMCall -->|failure| FallbackCache[Return cached answer / error]
  ReturnAnswer --> Display[Extension displays answer]
  FallbackCache --> Display
  Display --> End([Done])
